===European history===
Winning the domestic league the previous season for the first time, KPV qualified for the [[European Cup]] and played in a European competition for the first time in the [[1970–71 European Cup|1970-71]] season. [[Celtic F.C.|Celtic]] beat KPV in the first round with an aggregate of 0–14.

For the [[1974–75 UEFA Cup|1974–75]] season, the team managed to qualify in the [[UEFA Cup]], but [[1. FC Köln]] beat KPV in the first round with an aggregate of 2–9.

